-- l4 batch over a section input whose TYPICALLY default is an EXPRESSION
-- (TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md W7, R8 rule 3). A row that leaves `discount`
-- out takes a tenth of the `list price` THAT row gives, and `presumed` lists it.

§ `Pricing`
    GIVEN `list price` IS A NUMBER
          discount IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY (`list price` DIVIDED BY 10)

@export default Final price
GIVETH A NUMBER
`final price` MEANS `list price` MINUS discount
